        "This matters for African merchants in a very concrete way. The classic scam is a confident buyer who insists \"I already sent it, look at my phone\" while the money never actually arrives, or who reuses an old confirmation from a previous purchase. On a feature phone, without a tool like this, the merchant has no fast way to check and often just releases the goods. USSD verification closes that gap in seconds, on the exact device the merchant already owns.",
